{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>中秋佳節想親手製作月餅送禮？肥媽在《今個夏天食平D》節目中教大家製作這款傳統奶皇月餅！這款奶皇月餅烤香後外皮香脆如曲奇，裡面軟綿綿，而且真材實料包入新鮮鹹蛋黃，做到真正的皮薄餡好！只要掌握好材料比例以及冷藏定型的小技巧，在家也能輕鬆做出模具圖案清晰分明的精緻月餅！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f6876f4-96dd-41c0-b576-4194cf1bc629.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026tjbaJrLTQY1789983493.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f6876f4-96dd-41c0-b576-4194cf1bc629.png.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'>餅皮材料：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><p id=\"p-rc_93a28caf6493d162-533\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; mar